  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "不同Creation Treasure会提供完全不同的开局，并改变修炼与力量成长路线",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Each treasure gives you a completely different start, shaping how you cultivate and how your power grows.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2377930/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "三条主线通往不同命运，抢先体验已有约50万字并完整开放罗刹岛魔修路线",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "Forge Your Own Immortal Path Every choice pushes you toward a different destiny. The game is built around three major storylines, each taking you somewhere completely different, with its own tone and feel. The current Early Access build includes around 500,000 words of content and fully unlocks the \"Rakshasa Isle Demon Cultivator\" route, along with all its endings.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2377930/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "功法化为拼图塞入有限丹田空间，正确排列效果可触发共鸣加成",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Deep, Satisfying, and All Yours to Build Combat runs on a unique Dantian system: Your techniques take the form of puzzle pieces. Arrange them however you like within your limited Dantian space, and line up the right effects to trigger powerful resonance bonuses. The deeper you dig, the more combinations open up. Mix and match your techniques and spells to outmaneuver your enemies in action-bar turn-based combat.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2377930/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
